    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "一个女人死了105天，她的丈夫，却用她的微信，陪她妈妈聊了105天。",
      "sha256": "aa62ccb575228ac65eab53fa73a5f9c95fb5afbd9a5d28f6a83688250e59807d",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 2.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 8.9,
      "atempo": 1.2714,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "这是2017年震惊上海的冰柜藏尸案。",
      "sha256": "94f2708b92182fe96e0a46c1eedbc3dd4fea9b63835c723bac67291086afee18",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 9.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.435,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.565
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "朱晓东和杨俪萍，曾是让人羡慕的一对——他做商场职员，她是小学老师，朋友圈里全是旅行和甜蜜合影。",
      "sha256": "5b9edc662036d3dfa35a64658db4324643d825f9e72a3d55b309b4fb0977dcc0",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 14.0,
      "target_duration": 10,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 11.598,
      "atempo": 1.1598,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "可谁都没想到，这段婚姻走到最后，只剩下一台冰柜。",
      "sha256": "72b5c54dcafb8931d9f654619c35b51bfad197927348ce1f79e2d3a39aaed6a5",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.6,
      "atempo": 1.1,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "时间回到2016年10月17日。",
      "sha256": "3a60d4cfa1fb985128ba9b81cb74e9c7a3d4a33058d7a63a8665b1a2318d61eb",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 30.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.1,
      "atempo": 1.025,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "那天晚上，两人发生争执，",
      "sha256": "9c0c4da7db23e816fc2edea8f060937e7ff2a9923fa95416ebc452205f918849",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 34.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.508,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.492
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "妻子在家中遇害。",
      "sha256": "469e99f9738b232552a2b5407cc92e2e63a8bed9961eb6974859dc72dd0bbd79",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 38.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 1.916,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.084
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "面对突如其来的尸体，他没报警，也没逃跑——",
      "sha256": "de405ad9cb32ae3d29d4ff429359d509243c8c97ab22976d046821ba9de35926",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.133,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.867
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "他做了一个正常人无法理解的决定：把妻子藏进冰柜，然后，假装她还活着。",
      "sha256": "a737021f8cc4bec410e38187b560e9c1c833bc51bf6013129333ff9dc303e27c",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 47.0,
      "target_duration": 9,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.082,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.918
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "接下来的105天，是这起案件最让人脊背发凉的部分。",
      "sha256": "f6633d4ff05e8f668bdf001ec80b936cc9bf5fcd662a06e6184c8ac0303ad8a3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 56.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.712,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.288
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "朱晓东拿着妻子的手机，冒充她发朋友圈、回微信，",
      "sha256": "9a2b31a8e0aff9830ece524ed66a8f1d3817b47adecc8e16bf5185d25b4192a4",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 62.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.0,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "和她的父母、朋友、同事聊天，语气温柔，滴水不漏。",
      "sha256": "9b1bc33de1c6c2b10378441e53d4e1837418ae14a1eae03289939899d31139bc",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 68.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.921,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.079
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "母亲问“怎么不接电话”，",
      "sha256": "32b321e1acf5133babba074705d305fa393eb27889fd0a36db7676e32ed3e909",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 74.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.111,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.889
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "他回“在忙，别担心”。",
      "sha256": "849361c8bd4d2cbb8d51d7aa85841c666b772e3e0bea289aa2c24030f1aa8da6",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 78.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.0,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "与此同时，他拿妻子的身份证开房、",
      "sha256": "972716409f53aa192d424f54f8102bb655248157c7df2fa1d9b1b08ebd0c0e93",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 82.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.111,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.889
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "和别的女人约会，把日子过得风生水起。",
      "sha256": "5f2d1e77f41e3e41e8f35aa3933c834427af3b9d92f807f6a5d037d5beb8db29",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 87.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.435,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.565
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "妻子就躺在冰柜里，而他在演一场没人看穿的独角戏。",
      "sha256": "8887228a4a102a77c2d703a027d6f80d731daee41c67d12a94a1ef39362ab092",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 92.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.793,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.207
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "可再完美的表演，也有穿帮的一天。",
      "sha256": "cb01becd4b5be5eec93fe2bdda296b70fbe0a581013cc36624786bc5496dd007",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 98.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.239,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.761
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "杨俪萍的母亲一个多月联系不上女儿，发微信总回得莫名其妙。",
      "sha256": "5ef13c452d99f079d564eb98e0ac2d564758a15e42f0fc5fc5caf258a7f1d0b1",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 103.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.503,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.497
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "父亲越想越不对劲：",
      "sha256": "4a76b194dec2eade9f57537746c586e2a9e8ea042458f6bd8d8cc7c82d997b9b",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 110.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.299,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.701
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "女儿头像换了，说话口气也不像她。",
      "sha256": "ed672656e7ffece61f705d15079480ca4851ed3e96a55e54afa976ed44840a3a",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114.0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.214,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.786
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "2017年2月1日，大年初五，父亲报了警。",
      "sha256": "81c76ceb6556d3798948c12d32e8f8f57b94c0ec07c94f5cf4a36511be264fe6",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 119.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.027,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.973
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "当警察跟着朱晓东回家，",
      "sha256": "7af2a96e900df7ccf08f6d841b795030a3b9f24f957f951e42d8e7b8a14e3e87",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 125.0,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.601,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.399
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "拉开那台冰柜时，在场所有人都愣住了。",
      "sha256": "92d3e97bc973596125cc886a92f82663f7771dd3e91541d4e13f94a8e2946283",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 129.0,
      "target_duration": 8,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.924,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 4.076
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "真相大白。法庭上，朱晓东一度辩解说是冲动，但铁证如山。",
      "sha256": "2ccf0dea7a2b7cce916041187f84ad256a550524289ae15da944f1a22a2738ec",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.117,
      "atempo": 1.0167,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "一审被判死刑，二审维持原判，最高人民法院核准。",
      "sha256": "5ebbe4881e57f379753dd36c8ec2f7ab89e365874cbea7ad391eaa631aa0a07f",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 144.0,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.41,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.59
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "2019年1月，朱晓东被执行死刑，年仅32岁。那台冰柜，成了最刺眼的注脚。",
      "sha256": "c4f57ec3c18947d84acaefa93182e35a0363b08c4644cfcafdde30a06bbadf2e",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 151.0,
      "target_duration": 9,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 9.81,
      "atempo": 1.09,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "这个案子最恐怖的，不是手段，而是那105天——他能把最亲密的爱人当成“不存在”，一边藏尸，一边笑着说“我很好”。",
      "sha256": "779092b2d35f3d84cccb9978b0175a333d5620bcc64042370432129cb63727a8",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 160.0,
      "target_duration": 13,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 11.8,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "如果你是她父母，第几天会发现不对劲？评论区聊聊。",
      "sha256": "4d632acc2a86c278f5a12e187e429c5bab71982428a0832d0a05affef4e7e15a",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "低沉男声（Arena 试音仅一个候选，自动指派；比 voice-00 更低沉）",
      "narration_id": "N09",
